--TEST--
the bracketed `namespace` folds and everything it holds folds under it; a hook's body is a block on a method's terms, while the `{ get ... }` around the pair is not a span the tree keeps, `rule:classes/property-observer`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace App
{
    interface Greeter
    {
        public function greet(): string;
    }

    class User implements Greeter
    {
        public string $name {
            get {
                return "hi";
            }
        }

        public function greet(): string
        {
            return $this->name;
        }
    }
}
--REQUEST--
foldingRange
